  "limitations": [
    "Validated execution covers CellRank 2.3.2 VelocityKernel with RegVelo state and velocity layers, velocity-plus-connectivity sensitivity, PseudotimeKernel, and moscot 0.5.1 TemporalProblem through RealTimeKernel. Public zebrafish neural-crest acceptance is conditional on one official dataset, one RegVelo-derived velocity field, four annotation-defined terminal states, and withheld stage direction; terminal-state consistency is partly imposed by GPCCA clamping and is not independent biological validation. Fate probabilities depend on kernel, neighborhood, representation, time sampling, and terminal definitions and do not establish clonal ancestry, causal regulation, or condition-level inference. Execution requires a compatible project-approved scientific runtime."
  ],
